Subject: [PATCH 01/12] l1pair: strict launcher/config/preflight/readiness gate
 for a non-validating reth v2.8.0 + lighthouse v8.3.2 mainnet L1 source for
 the Base holder

Reuses S's committed holder launcher (08f2efe) as a library and its storage script byte-identical. Renders loopback-only
APIs, receipts retained 140,000 blocks, semi-supernode custody, explicit NAT/UPnP/DNS discovery, file checkpoint with
wss + provenance; refuses genesis sync, implicit checkpoint URLs, overlap with co-resident storage, unpinned binaries
and NVMe cache shares beyond the shared 200 GB target. Unit tests, stand-in gate tests, real-binary tests, mutants.
